ll/105145.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-10T21:58:10Z"},"body":"Partially addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9586, without introducing intrusive changes to the `Packed*Array`s.\r\n\r\nThis can be done with a script, but swapping large amount of data with a script is much slower. Irrelevant for C++, since it's trivial to do without extra methods, so added only as Variant methods.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n\tvar a0 : PackedByteArray = [00, 11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, 77, 88, 11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, 77, 88, 99]\r\n\tvar a1 = a0.duplicate()\r\n\ta1.bswap16(1)\r\n\tvar a2 = a0.duplicate()\r\n\ta2.bswap32(1)\r\n\tvar a3 = a0.duplicate()\r\n\ta3.bswap64(1)\r\n\tprint(a0) # [0, 11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, 77, 88, 11, 22, 33, 44, 55, 66, 77, 88, 99]\r\n\tprint(a1) # [0, 22, 11, 44, 33, 66, 55, 88, 77, 22, 11, 44, 33, 66, 55, 88, 77, 99]\r\n\tprint(a2) # [0, 44, 33, 22, 11, 88, 77, 66, 55, 44, 33, 22, 11, 88, 77, 66, 55, 99]\r\n\tprint(a3) # [0, 88, 77, 66, 55, 44, 33, 22, 11, 88, 77, 66, 55, 44, 33, 22, 11, 99]\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"ht